- Vite production bundle built successfully (179 modules transformed, existing large-chunk size warning).
- No changes have been deployed to the private `:8188` game. Actual listening and browser WebAudio validation remain required before production merging.# Bitstream Bluffs — BSOD proximity corruption, music-only (provisional)

