|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| Original 9 scenarios × 4 seeds | 0.5716 | 0.6273 | 0.5839 | **0.6468** |
| Withheld-offset echo scenarios × 4 seeds | 0.4182 | **0.6953** | 0.4305 | 0.6322 |
| Withheld-offset ghost scenarios × 4 seeds | **0.7060** | 0.3838 | 0.4942 | 0.5312 |

