</head><body><header><h1>🎹 Maxi’s <em>One More Run</em> — Piano-Friendly Melody Lab</h1>
<p class="intro">Four short listening passages. Compare <strong>the original vocal</strong>, <strong>simplified piano-style melody</strong>, and <strong>a selectively expressive piano interpretation</strong> over the same original accompaniment.</p>
<p class="note"><strong>Experimental and unverified:</strong> the piano lines are automated guesses, not a human-corrected transcription. They use a synthetic piano-like instrument, not an acoustic piano. The source Suno prompt says 160 BPM, but the recording’s exact beat phase is unverified, so source note onsets are preserved rather than forcibly snapped.</p>
<p class="intro"><strong>How to compare:</strong> play A, then B or C. Switching within a passage resumes near the same timestamp. Playing another passage stops the previous audio. This page has its own audio controls and never changes Bitstream Bluffs game preferences.</p></header><main>
