<header><span class="pill">Private sound-design sandbox • not deployed</span>
<h1>🌪️ BSOD Music Corruption — A/B Audition</h1>
<p>Hear real shipped stem recordings through the exact calibrated <strong>guitar, piano and Other</strong> threat processor. Change the BSOD danger live while a short passage loops.</p></header>
